{
  "format": 1,
  "description": "Two cart-poles side by side: the cart-pole example used twice as a component, each started with its pole tipped (left 0.15 rad, right -0.3 rad) and caught by its own controller. The scene draws each with the picture the cart-pole model offers, its template cartpole (ADR 0113), bound by name to the outputs it offers (x, theta) and placed in a frame of its own; the right one's pole is green by the template's parameter. Nothing of the picture is rebuilt here.",
